D）\n\n```\nUltra-modern skyscraper with flowing glass curtain wall, spiral ascending green terraces, mixed-use podium base, heavy snowfall in city, snowflakes falling, thin snow covering building surfaces, ground covered with snow, winter atmosphere, cold blue-white color palette, overcast thick clouds, soft diffused lighting, vehicles with snow on streets, pedestrians in winter clothing with umbrellas, snow-laden tree branches, CBD cityscape in snow, architectural photography, ultra HD details, 8K quality, photorealistic rendering, architectural visualization style --ar 2:3 --v 6\n```\n\n---\n\n## 关键调整要素说明\n\n| 元素 | 雪天处理 |\n|:---|:---|\n| 光线 | 阴天漫射光 → 冷调、低对比度 |\n| 色彩 | 原暖调天空 → 灰白/冰蓝色 |\n| 建筑表面 | 增加积雪层次与冰霜质感 |\n| 街道活动 | 行人添冬装、车辆减速痕迹 |\n| 氛围 | 添加飘雪粒子与雾气朦胧感 |\n\n如需调整雪量大小（小雪/暴雪）或时段（雪夜/雪后晴天），可进一步优化。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 292, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 170, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "e900c2ca9c0d90b0896881910ca7f3f02d88ebd8", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [278], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [281.1081848144531, 115.52632141113281], "pos": [-370, 430], "widgets_values": ["雪天"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 168, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281cec